				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				77,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(Grove): Update documentation URLs to PlayForm Cloud domain\n\nSync the `Documentation/Rust` submodule to update all references from the deprecated `Editor.Land` domain to the new `Land.PlayForm.Cloud` domain. This change affects the `README.md` badge images, documentation links, contact email, and project footer.\n\nEnsure external resources (Rust/WebAssembly icons, API docs, and documentation pages) resolve correctly under the new hosting infrastructure while maintaining the integrity of the Grove extension host documentation.",
			"SHA": "bffc59435393c4e0b7428526aaaadbf3dd2648cf"
		},
